{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appease your Otter god with a feast of tasty zombies\u2026 or suffer the hellish consequences!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use  anything as a weapon, yes, even your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/9cceadf54c0d52cb5c6a1631786ea4aa.poster.avif?t=1751632762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/9cceadf54c0d52cb5c6a1631786ea4aa.webm?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/9cceadf54c0d52cb5c6a1631786ea4aa.mp4?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wild mix of expected and totally unexpected weapons at The Wet Plank Tavern. Grab whatever you can find and see what chaos it brings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Proximity chat chaos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8a8b68cc5135e15d8b66e7e0ee5b4a1a.poster.avif?t=1751632762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8a8b68cc5135e15d8b66e7e0ee5b4a1a.webm?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8a8b68cc5135e15d8b66e7e0ee5b4a1a.mp4?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat cranks up the chaos! Throw your friends around (in-game) and hear what happens. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mayhem at The Wet Plank Tavern!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/454a8238144f7eac7b56e7e654c9fb3c.poster.avif?t=1751632762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/454a8238144f7eac7b56e7e654c9fb3c.webm?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/454a8238144f7eac7b56e7e654c9fb3c.mp4?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies have invaded the tavern, the Otter god is hungry, and your friends are acting as dumb and useless as ever. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bow before your Otter god!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/68cd4ff7cb69e675bbc90a80cb259ee3.poster.avif?t=1751632762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/68cd4ff7cb69e675bbc90a80cb259ee3.webm?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/68cd4ff7cb69e675bbc90a80cb259ee3.mp4?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat up those pesky zombies and serve them up to your all-powerful overlord! It's a fight for survival, will it be the zombies or the vampirates that reign supreme?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the vampirate your mother always wanted you to be!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8eb6c697d826e3247c8a22ce04090bea.poster.avif?t=1751632762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8eb6c697d826e3247c8a22ce04090bea.webm?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8eb6c697d826e3247c8a22ce04090bea.mp4?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop being such a disappointment and fight for your life! How long will you last? Probably not long, but whatever.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Fifth Ottering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/1f6c361aa6b9049cf0a987023fa582fc1abeeec0.jpg"},{"name":"Thirteen for the Fur-Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/6e19bcfe49d83eb6ccc5777f18ed4694d3092dad.jpg"},{"name":"Otternal Devotion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/e8b7a763a99b59831987abc1e5269debdd984995.jpg"},{"name":"Dunk of the Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/f0ef7bdd5fe091f10872602d6054bc34a72e918f.jpg"},{"name":"Alley-Oops, You're Alive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/e1707b1fa17be190330815e8c50422c10ff11cfa.jpg"},{"name":"Medic!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/8ebc915e6dde1bc662db0d15341d0a203a850483.jpg"},{"name":"Not a zombie fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/e8e7e51dcec0a079e42d9843140e31596ff29959.jpg"},{"name":"One more zombie and I\u2019m out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623280/1dd2792706d48331f880a72f14566fa20e057178.jpg"},{"name":"LET THE DEAD RISE. I\u2019VE BEEN WAITING FOR THIS MY WHOLE LIFE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app