g\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/68cd4ff7cb69e675bbc90a80cb259ee3.poster.avif?t=1751632762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/68cd4ff7cb69e675bbc90a80cb259ee3.webm?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/68cd4ff7cb69e675bbc90a80cb259ee3.mp4?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat up those pesky zombies and serve them up to your all-powerful overlord! It's a fight for survival, will it be the zombies or the vampirates that reign supreme?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the vampirate your mother always wanted you to be!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8eb6c697d826e3247c8a22ce04090bea.poster.avif?t=1751632762\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8eb6c697d826e3247c8a22ce04090bea.webm?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/extras/8eb6c697d826e3247c8a22ce04090bea.mp4?t=1751632762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop being such a disappointment and fight for your life! How long will you last? Probably not long, but whatever.</p>","developers":["Abonneer"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623280/8d342140460c2507a0ed67b713afd57d06a80ad8/header.jpg?t=1751632762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul clas